 "lore": {
  "intro": "The chapel deck. Folded.\nSix rooms around one. Or one room\naround six. The count depends on the walker.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "Ratio: I can't map this for you. Every route you take adds a room that was already there. Kill what moves and get to the heart."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "kills:14",
    "text": "Ratio: That was a Warden. The thing under the Core prints them, the way your seed prints frames. There will be a fresh one at the door."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: Core approach is open. The vault is down there \u2014 and so is the thing that holds the vault shut. If something makes you an offer, any offer: the offer is the weapon. Listen to me instead."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 0,
    "pos": [
     0,
     -60
    ],
    "text": "SERMON, UNDELIVERED\nThey ask: is the station haunted?\nNo. A haunting is a place remembering.\nThis is a place being remembered \u2014\nby something on the other side."
   }
  ]
 }
